framework,\nand no external DLLs beyond the OS inbox set.\n\nHighlights:\n- Single portable exe under 10 MB, with an idle memory footprint under 30 MB.\n- Dense, dark, keyboard-first UI designed for fast navigation over the mouse.\n- Virtualized tree and list views that stay smooth over 100k+ entries.\n- Bulk rename with reusable presets and live preview.\n- Dual-language UI (English and Korean).\n\nSettings and session data live next to the executable under data\\, falling back\nto %LOCALAPPDATA%\\NexaDir2\\data when the install directory is not writable.\nUninstalling keeps your data so a reinstall restores your settings.\n\nNexa Dir is free for personal and other noncommercial use under the PolyForm\nNoncommercial License 1.0.0. Commercial use requires a separate paid license.","moniker":"nexa-dir","name":"Nexa Dir","packageUrl":"https://sosomlab.com/apps/nexa-dir/","publisher":"SosomLab","publisherUrl":"https://sosomlab.com","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/SosomLab/nexa-dir2/releases/tag/0.8.1","tags":["explorer","file-manager","files","native","portable","rust","win32"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://sosomlab.com","releaseDate":"2026-07-19","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/SosomLab/nexa-dir2/releases/tag/0.8.1","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/s/SosomLab/NexaDir/0.8.1/SosomLab.NexaDir.yaml","sha256":"d47bf673e08b7e9ed6aedf081ce153225429570ce9988c934dd8c1d0ad4294c6"},{"path":"manifests/s/SosomLab/NexaDir/0.8.1/SosomLab.NexaDir.installer.yaml","sha256":"fe22237172fbc96a9dfba5cf2cb8783d98dc5d59ca405d7e7aaf714b0bac0ae6"},{"path":"manifests/s/SosomLab/NexaDir/0.8.1/SosomLab.NexaDir.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"e2a550bf2173cf6231fd52129837b2be9eae3e304f66a63d3fda2822c68a6cfa"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.8.1"}